消息的卡片","desc_en":"A card that displays messages in the corner of the interface"},{"key":"icon","cn":"状态图标","en":"Icon","desc":"区分信息 / 成功 / 警告","desc_en":"Differentiate information/success/warning"},{"key":"title","cn":"标题","en":"Title","desc":"一句话结论，加粗","desc_en":"Conclusion in one sentence, bold"},{"key":"body","cn":"详细描述","en":"Description","desc":"原因、影响和下一步入口","desc_en":"Causes, effects and next steps"},{"key":"close","cn":"关闭按钮","en":"Close","desc":"让用户按需关闭通知","desc_en":"Let users turn off notifications on demand"}]},"variants":[{"cn":"基础通知","en":"Basic","demo":"<div class=\"notification-card\"><i class=\"notification-dot\"></i><div class=\"notification-main\"><div class=\"notification-title\">新评论</div><div class=\"notification-desc\">「这个方案我觉得可以」</div></div><span class=\"notification-close\">×</span></div>","demo_en":"<div class=\"notification-card\"><i class=\"notification-dot\"></i><div class=\"notification-main\"><div class=\"notification-title\">New comment</div><div class=\"notification-desc\">\"I think this solution is okay\"</div></div><span class=\"notification-close\">×</span></div>","when":"有消息值得知道，但不急着处理","when_en":"There is news worth knowing, but there is no rush to deal with it"},{"cn":"带操作链接","en":"With Action","demo":"<div class=\"notification-card\"><i class=\"notification-dot\"></i><div class=\"notification-main\"><div class=\"notification-title\">导出完成</div><div class=\"notification-desc\">1,024 条数据已导出</div><span class=\"notification-link\">下载文件 →</span></div><span class=\"notification-close\">×</span></div>","demo_en":"<div class=\"notification-card\"><i class=\"notification-dot\"></i><div class=\"notification-main\"><div class=\"notification-title\">Export completed</div><div class=\"notification-desc\">1,024 pieces of data have been exported</div><span class=\"notification-link\">Download file →</span></div><span class=\"notification-close\">×</span></div>","when":"告知之外还要给一个下一步入口","when_en":"When users also need a clear way to continue."},{"cn":"警告类型","en":"Warning","demo":"<div class=\"notification-card is-warn\"><i class=\"notification-dot\"></i><div class=\"notification-main\"><div class=\"notification-title\">存储空间不足</div><div class=\"notification-desc\">剩余不到 500MB，请及时清理</div></div><span class=\"notification-close\">×</span></div>","demo_en":"<div class=\"notification-card is-warn\"><i class=\"notification-dot\"></i><div class=\"notification-main\"><div class=\"notification-title\">Insufficient storage space</div><div class=\"notification-desc\">Less than 500MB remaining, please clean up in time</div></div><span class=\"notification-close\">×</span></div>","when":"出现需要留意的隐患，如空间不足","when_en":"There are hidden dangers that need attention, such as insufficient space."}],"use":[{"t":"<b>审核 / 审批结果</b>：带原因和「查看详情」入口","m":"toast-notif"},{"t":"<b>新评论 / 新@提醒</b>：不是当下操作的直接结果","m":"notif-comment"},{"t":"<b>后台任务完成</b>：导出完成，附下载入口","m":"notif-task"},{"t":"<b>系统公告</b>：版本更新、活动通知","m":"notif-announce"}],"dont":[{"t":"“保存成功”等简短结果：使用 {c:toast}","m":"notif-as-toast","bad":true},{"t":"需要立即处理才能继续：使用 {c:modal} 限制后续操作","m":"modal-block"},{"t":"需要持续显示的提醒：使用 {c:alert}","m":"alert-notice"},{"t":"连续推送多条通知：会遮挡内容并分散注意力","m":"notif-stack","bad":true}],"lessonPractice":{"title":"用户启动报表导出后离开了原页面，文件五分钟后才生成。完成结果应该怎样告知？","options":[{"id":"persistent-download-notification","label":"写入可稍后查看的通知，并在其中提供文件名称和下载入口","feedback":"结果发生在原操作之后且需要后续处理，保留通知能让用户回来找到具体文件。","correct":true},{"id":"origin-page-toast","label":"在原页面显示两秒“导出完成”，时间到后自动消失","feedback":"用户已经离开原页面，短暂反馈很可能完全看不到，也无法稍后找到下载入口。","correct":false},{"id":"blocking-global-modal","label":"文件完成时在用户当前页面弹出不可关闭窗口，要求立即下载","feedback":"导出结果不需要打断当前任务；强制立即处理会让后台任务反过来阻塞用户。","correct":false}],"en":{"title":"A user starts a report export and leaves the page. The file becomes ready five minutes later. How should completion be communicated?","options":[{"id":"persistent-download-notification","label":"Create a notification that can be revisited, with the file name and download action","feedback":"The result occurs after the original action and needs follow-up, so a retained notification lets users find the exact file later.","correct":true},{"id":"origin-page-toast","label":"Show Export complete for two seconds on the original page and then dismiss it","feedback":"The user already left that page, so brief feedback may never be seen and provides no later download path.","correct":false},{"id":"blocking-global-modal","label":"Open a non-dismissible modal on the user's current page and require an immediate download","feedback":"Export completion does not block the current task. Forced handling turns a background task into an interruption.","correct":false}]}},"lessonAgentPrompt":{"title":"你可以这样告诉 AI Agent","text":"请让后台导出完成后写入通知中心，通知包含报表名称、完成时间和下载入口，未读状态可识别。不要只在原页面弹 Toast，也不要阻塞当前页面；验证用户切换页面后仍能找到并下载文件。","en":{"title":"You can say this to an AI Agent","text":"When a background export finishes, add a notification with the report name, completion time, download action, and clear unread state. Do not rely on a toast on the original page or block the current page. Verify it survives navigation."}},"scenes":["审核结果通知","新消息提醒","导出完成下载","版本更新公告"],"en":{"use":[{"t":"Background task completed","m":"toast-notif"},{"t":"A teammate mentioned the user","m":"notif-comment"},{"t":"A delayed job failed","m":"notif-task"},{"t":"An event that may need later review","m":"notif-announce"}],"dont":[{"t":"Use it for every tiny local action","m":"notif-as-toast","bad":true},{"t":"Show it once when the information must remain available","m":"modal-block"},{"t":"Hide the source or time of the event","m":"alert-notice"},{"t":"Send repeated notifications for the same unchanged state","m":"notif-stack","bad":true}],"scenes":["Export completed","New mention","Build failed","Approval request"],"sceneUI":["<div class=\"notif-scene\">\n      <div style=\"padding:14px 16px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:48%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:72%\"></i></div>\n      <div class=\"notification-card\"><i class=\"notification-dot\" style=\"background:var(--red)\"></i><div class=\"notification-main\"><div class=\"notification-title\">Failed review</div><div class=\"notification-desc\">The copy-to-copy ratio of the cover is too high, please adjust and resubmit. </div><span class=\"notification-link\">View reasons →</span></div><span class=\"notification-close\">×</span></div>\n    </div>","<div class=\"notif-scene\">\n      <div style=\"padding:14px 16px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:56%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:78%\"></i></div>\n      <div class=\"notification-card\"><img src=\"/assets/avatar-fox.png\" style=\"width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;flex:none\" alt=\"\"><div class=\"notification-main\"><div class=\"notification-title\">New comment</div><div class=\"notification-desc\">Alex Chen: \"I think this plan is okay, so I will follow this version.\"</div><span class=\"notification-link\">Reply →</span></div><span class=\"notification-close\">×</span></div>\n    </div>","<div class=\"notif-scene\">\n      <div style=\"padding:14px 16px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:44%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:70%\"></i></div>\n      <div class=\"notification-card\"><i class=\"notification-dot\" style=\"background:var(--green)\"></i><div class=\"notification-main\"><div class=\"notification-title\">Export completed</div><div class=\"notification-desc\">1,024 order data has been packaged. </div><span class=\"notification-link\">Download file →</span></div><span class=\"notification-close\">×</span></div>\n    </div>","<div class=\"notif-scene\">\n      <div style=\"padding:14px 16px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:52%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:76%\"></i></div>\n      <div class=\"notification-card\"><i class=\"notification-dot\"></i><di